105: 
106: - **Problem research:** interview lecturers and coordinators across several Asian institutions; observe current review tasks and measure time, handoffs and missing evidence.
107: - **Product market research:** test the department buyer, procurement constraints and willingness to pay; treat Section 27â€™s market figures as estimates requiring verification.
108: - **Course market intelligence:** show the actual boards, employers, locations, dates and reviewed sample behind each requirement; reserve trend graphics for comparable collection windows.
