110: Skillabi already offers curriculum-to-labour-market alignment and scores, so avoid claiming the category is new. Lyceumâ€™s defensible differentiation is the lecturer-controlled chain from exact quotation through constrained revision to an editable teaching artifact and review brief. [Lightcast Skillabi](https://lightcast.io/solutions/software/skillabi)
